### AI-Powered Medical Report Simplifier API Requests

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health

### 2. Main Endpoint: Text Input (Sample from PDF)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/simplify-report
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "CBC: Hemoglobin 10.2 g/dL (Low) , WBC 11,200 /uL (High)",
  "trace": true
}

### 3. Main Endpoint: Text Input with OCR Typos (Sample from PDF)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/simplify-report
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "CBC: Hemglobin 10.2 g/dL (Low)\nWBC 11200 /uL (Hgh)",
  "trace": true
}

### 4. Main Endpoint: Test Guardrail / Anti-Hallucination Exit Condition
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/simplify-report
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "CBC: Hemoglobin 10.2 g/dL (Low) , WBC 11,200 /uL (High)",
  "simulate_hallucination": true
}

### 5. Main Endpoint: Image Upload (Dedicated OCR)
# In cURL:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/simplify-report \
#   -F "file=@samples/sample_report.png" \
#   -F "trace=true"

### 6. Step 1 Isolated: Extract Raw Tests & Fix Typos
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/extract-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "CBC: Hemglobin 10.2 g/dL (Low)\nWBC 11200 /uL (Hgh)"
}

### 7. Step 2 Isolated: Normalize Tests
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/normalize-tests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tests_raw": [
    "Hemoglobin 10.2 g/dL (Low)",
    "WBC 11200 /uL (High)"
  ],
  "confidence": 0.8
}

### 8. Step 3 Isolated: Patient-Friendly Summary
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/summarize
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "name": "Hemoglobin",
    "value": 10.2,
    "unit": "g/dL",
    "status": "low",
    "ref_range": { "low": 12.0, "high": 15.0 }
  },
  {
    "name": "WBC",
    "value": 11200,
    "unit": "/uL",
    "status": "high",
    "ref_range": { "low": 4000, "high": 11000 }
  }
]
